---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy policy — OpsPrimer"
  description="What data OpsPrimer collects, and what it does not."
>
  <h1>Privacy policy</h1>

  <p><em>Last updated: 14 August 2026</em></p>

  {/* ⚠️ Esta politica descreve a stack ATUAL do site:
      Cloudflare Pages + Cloudflare Web Analytics, sem cookies, sem formulario.

      SE VOCE ADICIONAR qualquer coisa — formulario do HubSpot, GA4, embed de
      video, fonte externa, chat — ATUALIZE ESTE TEXTO NO MESMO COMMIT.
      Politica desatualizada e pior que politica nenhuma: vira declaracao falsa. */}

  <p>
    Short version: this site sets no cookies, runs no advertising, and does not
    collect your email. What follows is the detail.
  </p>

  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>
    This site uses Cloudflare Web Analytics. It sets no cookies, stores no
    identifier on your device, and does not track you across other sites.
    Visitor counts are computed server-side from request data that is hashed and
    discarded. I see which pages are read and roughly where readers come from —
    nothing that identifies you personally.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>
    This site sets no cookies of its own. That's why you're not seeing a cookie
    banner.
  </p>

  <h2>Hosting and server logs</h2>
  <p>
    The site is hosted on Cloudflare Pages. To serve and protect the site,
    Cloudflare processes standard request data — including your IP address —
    transiently. This is handled under Cloudflare's own privacy terms.
  </p>

  <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
  <p>
    Some outbound links are affiliate links. When you click one, the destination
    company may set its own cookie in order to attribute the referral. That
    happens on <em>their</em> site, under <em>their</em> privacy policy — not
    this one. Nothing is set on your device before you click. See the
    <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a> for who those
    companies are.
  </p>

  <h2>Email</h2>
  {/* ⚠️ Enquanto NAO houver formulario, mantenha este paragrafo como esta.
      Ao adicionar o form do HubSpot, substitua descrevendo: o que e coletado,
      com que finalidade, onde fica armazenado (HubSpot, EUA) e como cancelar. */}
  <p>
    This site does not currently collect email addresses and does not run a
    newsletter. If that changes, this page will be updated before the form goes
    live.
  </p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>
    This site is aimed at people running businesses and is not directed at
    children under 13.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    If the site's stack changes, this page is updated and the date at the top
    changes with it.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Any question about data on this site:
    <a href="mailto:michelthedev@gmail.com">michelthedev@gmail.com</a>
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
